      "writtenOn": "2026-10-16T22:33:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: Check `if (boxheight \u003e 85)` first and advance `src_uv +\u003d (x \u003e\u003e 16) * 2;` once to simplify the pointer arithmetic and avoid the `(ptrdiff_t)` casts:\n```cpp\n  // 255 * boxheight * 3 has to stay inside the 16 bit accumulator.\n  if (boxheight \u003e 85) {\n    ScaleUVAddCols1_C(dst_width, boxheight, x, dx, src_uv, dst_uv);\n    return;\n  }\n  int n \u003d dst_width \u0026 ~7;\n  src_uv +\u003d (x \u003e\u003e 16) * 2;\n  if (n) {\n    ScaleUVAddCols3_AVX2(n, 65536 / (3 * boxheight), src_uv, dst_uv);\n  }\n  if (n \u003c dst_width) {\n    ScaleUVAddCols1_C(dst_width - n, boxheight, 0, dx, src_uv + n * 6,\n                      dst_uv + n * 2);\n  }\n```",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "cff8d87ca3cd3cf6c68bcefdd6a0cd4ef325699b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
