      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: Because this checks `!(dx \u0026 0xffff) \u0026\u0026 (dx \u003e\u003e 16) \u003d\u003d 3`, it triggers when `src_width` is an exact multiple of `3 * dst_width` (e.g., 1080p -\u003e 360p where UV is `960x540 -\u003e 320x180`), but is bypassed for 720p -\u003e 240p (`1280x720 -\u003e 426x240` or `427x240`, UV `640x360 -\u003e 213x120` or `214x120`, as in `By3Rounded`) where `dx \u003d FixedDiv(640, 213) \u003d 0x30136` has a non-zero fraction and falls back to `ScaleUVAddCols2_C`. Worth noting in a comment here.",
